      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 146.72,
      "end": 152.58,
      "text": "His lucky photograph kept burning in the wallet where he kept it hid",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 152.58,
      "end": 159.32,
      "text": "Rico got 9-11 bringing water to some thirsty kids",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 162.1,
      "end": 166.78,
      "text": "Benji heard a shout behind him, turned too quickly through the smoke",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 166.78,
      "end": 169.22,
      "text": "Our own gunner saw a shadow",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 169.22,
      "end": 171.96,
      "text": "Pulled the trigger, that was all",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 171.96,
      "end": 173.76,
      "text": "The report misidentification",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 173.76,
      "end": 176.36,
      "text": "Then buried what the panic did",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 176.36,
      "end": 178.34,
      "text": "When she got 9-11",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 178.34,
      "end": 182.14,
      "text": "By the frightened hands of frightened kids",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 184.82,
      "end": 187.9,
      "text": "Cold mark blue, smoke by the orchard",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 187.9,
      "end": 191.48,
      "text": "Called our position twice and clear",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 191.48,
      "end": 194.86,
      "text": "Jets arrived above the cloud line",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 194.86,
      "end": 198.02,
      "text": "The wrong coordinates reached their ears",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 199.02,
      "end": 202.1,
      "text": "The medals came in polished boxes",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 202.1,
      "end": 205.32,
      "text": "And his mother asked me what they meant",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 206.32,
      "end": 208.38,
      "text": "Code got 9-11",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
